  "tip": "<p>When you see requirements for <i>near zero downtime</i> and a relational source, look for managed <i>continuous replication</i> that enables an easy <i>cutover</i> and simple <i>rollback</i>. Prefer solutions that preserve the existing data model first, then refactor after the move.</p>",
